    "reference": "Photo at the uninterrupted camera session start. Use only the primary start for positioning and both respective measured starts for the two endpoint predictions. Compare each signed change with the same frozen dose. No adjustments to the dose model during the tests.",
    "exception": "Positioning and stationary images may be repeated before the first wet command for that trial. A projection or optical problem after that command stays in the denominator. Safety return and original device settings take precedence."
  },
